Package: zuint
Title: Lossless Signed and Unsigned 64- And 128-Bit Integers
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("The Apache Software Foundation", role = "cph",
           comment = "Arrow C Data Interface header in src/vendor/arrow/abi.h")
  )
Description: Wide integer vectors, signed and unsigned 64-bit and 128-bit,
    matching the integer types of databases and columnar formats. The four
    types share one 'C' core and one lossless promotion order, with exact
    arithmetic, comparison, parsing and formatting, and explicit overflow
    policies. The signed 64-bit type keeps the 'bit64' 'integer64' storage
    layout. With 'zuarrow' installed, the types read and write Arrow columns
    exactly.
